  "description": "A lightweight and reusable .NET library for handling secure and organized file uploads.  \nSupports configurable maximum file size, allowed extensions, and structured folder organization within wwwroot.  \nAutomatically generates unique filenames and returns relative paths for easy integration with your application's BaseUrl.",
